                                "sense_id": "ad0365d7-037e-3831-a47c-6dbd0416e39c",
                                "text": "In 1898 Russia acquired a naval base in China, at Port Arthur (now part of the city of Lüda); Japan took over this base in 1905, Russia regained it in 1945, but in 1955 it was returned to China."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c76b0ca9-34f9-4288-94e3-ed9f954a1ded",
                                "sense_id": "ad0365d7-037e-3831-a47c-6dbd0416e39c",
                                "text": "Lüda\nLüda is a double city composed of Lüshun and Dalian, located at the tip of the Liaodong Peninsula in Liaoning Province."
                            }
                        ]
